---
description: >-
  Legacy v1 state diagram exercising explicit fork and
  join state annotations at the top level: a fork splits into
  State2/State3, which then rejoin at a join state before continuing to
  State4.
config:
  logLevel: 0
  fontFamily: courier
---
stateDiagram
  state fork_state &lt;&lt;fork&gt;&gt;
  [*] --> fork_state
  fork_state --> State2
  fork_state --> State3

  state join_state &lt;&lt;join&gt;&gt;
  State2 --> join_state
  State3 --> join_state
  join_state --> State4
  State4 --> [*]
